Just be careful -- there may be such a thing as being Too Lucky Too Early.
When your Luck gets as high as 8, you become eligible for the dreaded
Hand of Elbereth.  Sure you might get some intrinsics, if you haven't
gotten them already.  You probably will get an artifact weapon (if you
aren't a Lawful using something other than a long sword).  If you are
already doing well in these categories, the Hand of Elbereth (and its
siblings) is more of a curse.

There was a little discussion a little back about justifying this curse
with regard to game balance.  IMNSHO, The Gehennom effect and the effect
of defeating WoY sufficient addresses the issue.  I made the mistake of
being so "blessed" when I was still level 11/12, before I even got to
the bottom of the Mines.

